Electromagnetism — charge, fields, matter, waves and physical evidence (@electromagnetism: 0, is #chapter, #electromagnetism "foundations/Reading-from-zero-to-advanced-fields.lingua#r_3PMR408MBJV3M39SCRZGR7S9RF") { r_5TJPESCTTNAKY66JH2QNQYN1PY
Begin with ordinary observations and develop the field explanations behind electricity, magnetism, matter, circuits, machines, propagation, radiation and measurement. The same shared physics supports modern power, instruments, communications, manufacturing and devices.

Start with [Reading from zero to advanced electromagnetic study](foundations/Reading-from-zero-to-advanced-fields.lingua#r_3PMR408MBJV3M39SCRZGR7S9RF). [Electromagnetic sources — complete books, courses, methods and research](Sources.lingua#r_6XW0N80NM6WSDWED10N8N7WX3P) identifies complete books, course programmes and primary methods; [A complete practical and academic programme](study/A-complete-practical-and-academic-programme.lingua#r_4XEMVM6SXP5T369FTCJ14H53YX) describes the demanding practical, academic and research work. The route starts without assumed university physics training and introduces the mathematical tools where they are used.

**First explanations and mathematics:** [A physical question, an observation and an explanatory model](foundations/Begin-with-an-electromagnetic-question.lingua#r_1PMJFESWTM62NGP42X33D125WA), [Charge, field, potential, current and energy are different quantities](foundations/Charge-field-potential-current-and-energy.lingua#r_73F672N5XQ9B4B1MPJAKCK2EGS), [Geometry, time scale and the range of a model](foundations/Geometry-time-scale-and-model-scope.lingua#r_4WAT0ASSD1WYXGBDTKWTFWZ7VZ), [Electromagnetic units and the post-2019 SI](foundations/Electromagnetic-units-and-physical-constants.lingua#r_50N03RM640KWQ6S5DQQJ5ADRAX), [Vectors, coordinate fields and flux](mathematics/Vectors-coordinate-fields-and-flux.lingua#r_65BCQQW5JWE20Y2P34YD6AD09V), [Gradient, divergence, curl and integral theorems](mathematics/Gradient-divergence-curl-and-integral-theorems.lingua#r_05M47N16QDCC5B927TEYXAMMA4) and [Charge conservation and current density](foundations/Charge-conservation-and-current-density.lingua#r_16QY5HH6CZN53EJ3J1AERMB3TA) connect familiar phenomena to quantitative fields and conservation.

**Static fields and matter:** [Coulomb force, superposition and a test charge](electrostatics/Coulomb-force-superposition-and-test-charge.lingua#r_4BCJ9YGVJSTWDV9S67V2RDR1YD), [Gauss law, symmetry and what flux does not determine](electrostatics/Gauss-law-symmetry-and-what-flux-does-not-determine.lingua#r_6EEA738C5T368TVSQ82K6J5QBY), [Work, potential difference and reference choice](electrostatics/Work-potential-difference-and-reference-choice.lingua#r_0KDY19PKDZXWKFN38GPNQMKR3N), [Poisson, Laplace and boundary data](electrostatics/Poisson-Laplace-and-boundary-data.lingua#r_2ED6JFNCPEGRT1P8KTP2Y7WPZG), [Green functions, reciprocity and source response](electrostatics/Green-functions-reciprocity-and-source-response.lingua#r_1H8R91AG0Q7EHDWGPKNG6E7JAQ), [Multipoles, origin choice and far-field error](electrostatics/Multipoles-origin-choice-and-far-field-error.lingua#r_6WSMWK4DFGSGKMGH6WTQJGB19H), [Capacitance matrices, energy and coupled conductors](electrostatics/Capacitance-matrices-energy-and-coupled-conductors.lingua#r_5YD0CB4H4ZCG21KKZKWERD77YK), [Dipoles, polarization and bound charge](matter/Dipoles-polarization-and-bound-charge.lingua#r_0ZFQN93KF28Y07MHTSCDABZ443) and [Anisotropy, nonlinearity, locality and history](matter/Anisotropy-nonlinearity-locality-and-material-history.lingua#r_56YXQANA62QHAYXPAFSK9V43KQ) develop sources, boundaries, energy and material response. [Drift, diffusion, relaxation and Ohm law](currents/Drift-diffusion-relaxation-and-Ohm-law.lingua#r_3P3417NJ3B753K217S24RZY08D), [Circuit approximations, sources and power](currents/Circuit-approximations-sources-resistance-and-power.lingua#r_0Y05GYZKN18BT1FY2GGQ6476W2), [Voltmeters, probes, return paths and loading](measurement/Voltmeters-probes-return-paths-and-loading.lingua#r_1GC52AMZ8AGAPCFD5Y0N9NWJWM), [RC, RL and RLC transients and energy](currents/RC-RL-RLC-transients-and-energy.lingua#r_4F9B677SF6134C9JSNNYZ94QCJ), [Complex amplitude, frequency and sign conventions](currents/Complex-amplitude-frequency-and-sign-conventions.lingua#r_5TBWGB70EQDF2DWG4NAWA8QRBK) and [Impedance, resonance, passivity and quality factor](currents/Impedance-resonance-passivity-and-quality-factor.lingua#r_7ATZTVDYNEVH4RS80RSV55W07Y) connect fields to transport, timing, phases and actual measurements.

**Magnetism and changing fields:** [Magnetic force, orbits and energy transfer](magnetostatics/Magnetic-force-orbits-and-energy-transfer.lingua#r_34G06XMD2AYC7EC9ADQQNQFA0R), [Biot–Savart fields of steady currents](magnetostatics/Biot-Savart-fields-of-steady-currents.lingua#r_2K157JSDFF7RY1VAPJKJ82VKFA), [Vector potential, gauge and linked flux](magnetostatics/Vector-potential-gauge-and-linked-flux.lingua#r_3DPJ91YTSE9VC10VWH8G6AA5XM), [Magnetization, bound currents, H and hysteresis](matter/Magnetization-bound-currents-H-and-hysteresis.lingua#r_1H8D8KMFTHN04KYDW84T64CQ2J), [Faraday law, Lenz law and changing flux](induction/Faraday-law-Lenz-law-and-changing-flux.lingua#r_15N270EPVSG2RM9NEK94YGX7RR), [Self-inductance, mutual inductance and magnetic energy](induction/Self-mutual-inductance-and-magnetic-energy.lingua#r_4QR58S6KHFRSBV15QCCX7NA63E), [Motors, generators, transformers and energy accounts](induction/Motors-generators-transformers-and-energy-accounts.lingua#r_3G4DF28F72Y3GD5QRG19CD75W8) and [Quasistatic limits, diffusion and skin depth](induction/Quasistatic-limits-diffusion-and-skin-depth.lingua#r_7RSC1KG4B4DNB7C7319F691MSW) lead into [Maxwell equations and displacement current](dynamics/Maxwell-equations-and-displacement-current.lingua#r_4ETBPA07D21W3J864XWFXHN4X5), [Poynting theorem, energy flow and dissipation](dynamics/Poynting-theorem-energy-flow-and-dissipation.lingua#r_5QQ630P1MWY515P876101QHTAE), [Field momentum, vacuum stress and material forces](dynamics/Field-momentum-vacuum-Maxwell-stress-and-material-forces.lingua#r_0JWB2N6JEY5498VNAM64CBHB6N), [Scalar/vector potentials and gauge choice](dynamics/Scalar-vector-potentials-and-gauge-choice.lingua#r_0BW4D2YAXHAFYBP2ZPVZZ9XEBX), [Special relativity joins electric and magnetic fields](dynamics/Special-relativity-electric-and-magnetic-fields.lingua#r_789H7ACJDQAKVB8H10HXAM09PC), [Four-current, field tensor and covariant equations](dynamics/Four-current-field-tensor-and-covariant-equations.lingua#r_3QWFTQD6180HHM0G8NGYZRYAZ1) and [Action, variation, symmetry and conservation](dynamics/Action-variation-symmetry-and-conservation.lingua#r_7RVHKMS4NGF4V2MPSSM3J4RDM8).

**Waves and radiation:** [Wave equation, speed and initial data](waves/Wave-equation-speed-and-initial-data.lingua#r_2QYBJYED0RXYF436544V27EJ46), [Polarization, complex vectors and Stokes parameters](waves/Polarization-complex-vectors-and-Stokes-parameters.lingua#r_35HQG1V7NGMHF15D31PM6T4P1P), [Fresnel reflection, refraction and Brewster angle](waves/Fresnel-reflection-refraction-and-Brewster-angle.lingua#r_5X8JFEWJNR27PDCQQX5CG9WWA9), [Dispersion, pulses and three meanings of velocity](matter/Dispersion-pulses-phase-group-and-front-velocity.lingua#r_62MGEANY8E8CA374CPVJ5H203D), [Causal response, Kramers–Kronig and finite-band limits](matter/Causal-response-Kramers-Kronig-and-sum-rule-limits.lingua#r_7Q2917ZCYG5ERX5WJDW3RXX8GY), [Distributed lines, return conductors and telegrapher equations](transmission/Distributed-lines-return-conductors-and-telegrapher-equations.lingua#r_3XY92DMB6E0C5HB0YYNQTDGRES), [Waveguide modes, cutoff and field boundaries](transmission/Waveguide-modes-cutoff-and-field-boundaries.lingua#r_3G14MTZDHF8SK3T0BEFQ8HPFP3), [Retarded potentials, near fields and radiation zone](radiation/Retarded-potentials-near-fields-and-radiation-zone.lingua#r_021CHNJF2T7759JNHH4AZ0GG09), [Electric/magnetic dipole radiation and angular power](radiation/Electric-magnetic-dipole-radiation-and-angular-power.lingua#r_4BPSV3J0C046ZSABN6VE17JE7B), [Antennas, gain, aperture, efficiency and reciprocity](radiation/Antennas-gain-aperture-efficiency-and-reciprocity.lingua#r_1578RDNQH3K3RR4GWDMHGP292K), [Scattering, polarizability and resonant response](radiation/Scattering-polarizability-Rayleigh-and-resonant-response.lingua#r_6FYBVTP1TQ9W5HZWNEBBQ9GP30) and [Extinction, optical theorem and conservation tests](radiation/Extinction-optical-theorem-and-conservation-tests.lingua#r_4FDDB20D8BRMC28ZFKTKZXMEJV) connect physical derivations, material assumptions and observable power.

**Computation and evidence:** [Field discretization, boundaries and observables](computation/Field-discretization-equations-boundaries-and-observables.lingua#r_3HYVJQ7HP9QQG81XSQ8B5EDV3P), [An inspectable conservative electrostatic solver](computation/An-inspectable-conservative-electrostatic-solver.lingua#r_5M84JGBFDFE7QQVSBX3S0TMASK), [An inspectable lossless dielectric stack](computation/An-inspectable-lossless-dielectric-stack.lingua#r_2B5TPEKP76WN8CJ5EE31FVREY8), [An inspectable periodic Yee wave](computation/An-inspectable-periodic-Yee-wave.lingua#r_7HQHSXPAZ45JWXAC5G48DC8D10), [Finite domains, sources, PML and reflection tests](computation/Finite-domains-sources-PML-and-reflection-tests.lingua#r_3HA5JXCH0JJR2BYHJ8AFHKZ9MV), [Fit dispersive materials with physical and numerical tests](computation/Fit-dispersive-materials-with-physical-and-numerical-tests.lingua#r_6FQ5BD11V41QDWJJMYQFJQKDWW), [Inverse fields, identifiability and regularization](measurement/Inverse-fields-identifiability-regularization-and-prior-information.lingua#r_3SFTJFY73PCPPREDHPDKKPQC9E), [From fields to detector signals and noise](measurement/From-fields-to-detector-signals-and-noise.lingua#r_3FQB4EV0F0QVWBSE9QBZDHT7AH) and [Uncertainty, model discrepancy and an electromagnetic claim](measurement/Uncertainty-model-discrepancy-and-an-electromagnetic-claim.lingua#r_2KYWTMX0SHJYWAH69AQ9H3068X) provide inspectable calculations and methods. [A complete practical and academic programme](study/A-complete-practical-and-academic-programme.lingua#r_4XEMVM6SXP5T369FTCJ14H53YX) branches to sixteen substantial advanced investigations and rejoins [An integrated electromagnetic-system investigation](study/An-integrated-electromagnetic-system-investigation.lingua#r_1FQW2ASX2WCT3JRXKKP4NB4HSN), [Independent electromagnetic scholarship and revision](research/Independent-electromagnetic-scholarship-and-revision.lingua#r_5TR9B1MTPCC16K9KHJ5AVEGFHM) and [Electromagnetic understanding and demanding completion](study/Electromagnetic-understanding-and-demanding-completion.lingua#r_5V4JAZ01138S2ZPPTDY5J2B1G3).

Ordinary `#electromagnetism` assertions select the learning connections. Other references support exploration without expanding that selection. Shared quantitative, metrology and computational Records have distinct continuations here. [Physics — fields, matter, motion and physical evidence](../Physics.lingua#r_04A5CP8RTBERZEN4XCCDQ3T47W), [Ergon — useful labor and productive knowledge](../../../Ergon.lingua#r_FE78A5A2D2A3261F711703DCC1), [Inquiry — shared ways to understand and investigate](../../inquiry/Inquiry.lingua#r_75MNKZQKNB0XBG021SWWW2HASB) and [Philosophy](../../../../scholazein/philosophy/Philosophy.lingua#r_00000000000000000000001001) connect physical understanding and methods; [Engineering — systems, design, construction, and operation](../../engineering/Engineering.lingua#r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68), [Resources and materials — feedstocks, useful properties, production, and recovery](../../materials/Materials.lingua#r_14HP6K610XB12E2WGNK9A6VN8D) and [Hephaestus](../../Hephaestus.lingua#r_00000000000000000000002001) connect production, use and upkeep. No special Trail object, manifest or view is required.

